  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 307.02 Scope. The provisions of this part shall be used by insurers to determine minimum standards of valuation for annuity and pure endowment contracts, subject to RSA 410:3.\n\nSource. #3163, eff 12-24-85; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5657, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7015, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRED: 10-29-99\n\nNew. #7450, eff 2-16-01; ss by #9494, eff 6-29-09; ss by #12034, eff 12-31-16",
